{"complete":true,"city":"Xi’an","template_id":"global-guidebooks-miss","title":"What the Guidebooks Miss: 10 Places Locals Deal Each Other","description":"Ten pieces of Xi’an’s working social fabric: breakfast lanes, secondhand stalls, public reading rooms, neighborhood parks, and cultural spaces that keep the city’s memory in circulation.","icon":"fingerprint","cards":[{"entity_name":"Xicang Market","title":"Xicang Market","subtitle":"The old-city ritual called “wandering the stalls”","notes":"Pass this on for the unruly mix: secondhand household goods, old books, handicrafts, flowers, birds, and fish. An account carried by China.org.cn identifies “逛档子”—wandering Xicang’s stalls—as a distinct habit among local residents, not a claim inferred from tourist reviews.","short_summary":"A century-old trading ground where browsing, bargaining, and reuse remain part of neighborhood life.","source_url":"https://www.china.org.cn/2025-07/30/content_118002682_3.shtml","source_title":"Century-old Xicang Market in Xi'an brimming with vitality","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Xiaonanmen Morning Market","title":"Xiaonanmen Morning Market","subtitle":"Breakfast folded into a working produce market","notes":"This 342-meter convenience market is useful for seeing two morning routines share one lane: residents buying vegetables and breakfast counters serving Xi’an staples. The World Tourism Cities Federation’s city magazine explicitly describes it as part of local daily life and a place Xi’an friends use for breakfast.","short_summary":"Come for breakfast, but notice that the lane still performs its original job as a neighborhood market.","source_url":"https://media.wtcf.org.cn/M00/03/3E/rBFBuWUKkG6AabyNAhy3YgSKgIs847.pdf","source_title":"城市巡游｜City PARADE","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Lao Cai Chang Folk Culture and Creative Block","title":"Lao Cai Chang Folk Culture and Creative Block","subtitle":"A creative district that still sells vegetables","notes":"The former Jianguomen market was not cleared into a single-purpose leisure complex. Xinhua’s local report says produce, meat, repair work, and other everyday services continue beside studios and cultural businesses. That coexistence—not novelty for its own sake—is the reason to share it.","short_summary":"A useful case study in city renewal where household errands and creative work occupy the same block.","source_url":"https://beilin.xiancity.cn/system/2026/02/02/031238016.shtml","source_title":"新华社聚焦碑林区：出圈！菜市场多了“新”选择","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Xi’an City Memory Museum","title":"Xi’an City Memory Museum","subtitle":"Ordinary objects treated as civic evidence","notes":"The collection concentrates on commonplace objects from roughly the past century—cooking tools, furniture, farm implements, photographs, and domestic ephemera. The museum’s charter says these materials are used to reconnect the public with earlier urban life and supplement the conventional museum system.","short_summary":"A museum for the household-scale history that grand dynastic narratives tend to leave outside the frame.","source_url":"https://www.urbanmuseum.cn/nd.jsp?fromColId=107&id=70","source_title":"西安市城市记忆博物馆章程","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Yisu Theater Cultural District","title":"Yisu Theater Cultural District","subtitle":"Qin Opera returned to an open-air stage","notes":"The district restored an outdoor opera stage so the public could encounter Qin Opera directly. A municipal report records nearly 90 admission-free Qin Opera performances during the district’s first months—concrete evidence of its role as an accessible performance space rather than scenery built around an old theater.","short_summary":"A living performance precinct where Qin Opera is staged in public, not simply commemorated behind glass.","source_url":"https://en.xa.gov.cn/ztzl/NinthChinaQinOperaArtFestival/1691691586951958529.html","source_title":"Xi'an Yisu Theater Cultural District holds Qin Opera","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Fortifications of Xi'an","title":"Xi’an City Wall","subtitle":"The fortification doubles as a public culture platform","notes":"The less obvious use of the wall is contemporary: Xi’an’s government says it works with museums and intangible-cultural-heritage institutions on regular performances, public-interest lectures, and exhibitions. Check the current program rather than treating the circuit only as a monument or photo backdrop.","short_summary":"Beyond the ramparts, the wall operates as a long-form venue for lectures, performances, and heritage demonstrations.","source_url":"https://en.xa.gov.cn/MediaCenter/News/2075158116966174721.html","source_title":"Xi'an City Wall launches special summer offerings","latitude":34.276795,"longitude":108.947241,"place_id":"ChIJodN_-FZ6YzYRhtqcQ2dSq7k","maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJodN_-FZ6YzYRhtqcQ2dSq7k"},{"entity_name":"Shaanxi Provincial Library High-tech Branch","title":"Shaanxi Provincial Library High-tech Branch","subtitle":"A full afternoon of public culture under one roof","notes":"The provincial library designed this branch around more than book retrieval: reading, education, exhibitions, cultural leisure, and organized activities share the building. A provincial budget document confirms that all three Shaanxi Library branches are open to the public without admission charge.","short_summary":"A large public reading space built for lingering, learning, and joining cultural programs.","source_url":"https://whhlyt.shaanxi.gov.cn/zfxxgk/fdzdgknr/ysjs/202503/P020250313646401089590.pdf","source_title":"陕西省图书馆（陕西省古籍保护中心）2025年单位预算公开说明","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Xi’an Library at Chang’an Academy","title":"Xi’an Library at Chang’an Academy","subtitle":"The city library as a network, not just a building","notes":"The new municipal library can receive 15,000 readers a day and links the city’s 13 district and county libraries through shared borrowing and returns. Its resource-sharing relationships with universities and research institutes make this a practical recommendation for readers who need more than a photogenic study hall.","short_summary":"Xi’an’s new central library connects neighborhood collections to a much larger shared reading system.","source_url":"https://www.nationalreading.gov.cn/ydkj/dmsg/202501/t20250120_882620.html","source_title":"长安书院正式“开卷” 西安市图书馆新馆打造高品质文化消费新场景","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Xingqing Palace Park","title":"Xingqing Palace Park","subtitle":"A historic site used as an everyday walking park","notes":"The palace history is only half the handoff. Xi’an’s municipal site identifies the park as a particularly popular recreation area for residents and specifically recommends it for walking; admission is also reported as free. That makes it useful when someone needs open space, not another ticketed itinerary.","short_summary":"A substantial lake park where Tang history sits inside an ordinary resident recreation space.","source_url":"https://en.xa.gov.cn/MediaCenter/News/1691691417036509185.html","source_title":"Xingqing Palace Park in Xi'an presents splendid winter views","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Daming Palace National Heritage Park","title":"Daming Palace National Heritage Park","subtitle":"Archaeology planned as neighborhood breathing room","notes":"The managing authority describes the site’s modern civic role plainly: an urban “green lung” providing residents and visitors with recreation and quiet, alongside museums and archaeological interpretation. Use that distinction when choosing between the broad park landscape and its ticketed interior attractions.","short_summary":"A major archaeological landscape that also functions as open space for the surrounding city.","source_url":"https://qjxq.xa.gov.cn/zjqj/gyqj/tsqj/5df21c62fd8508098d284f14.html","source_title":"大明宫遗址公园","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null}],"warnings":[]}
